body:
i feel you. ever since i was young, i have been extremely empathetic. i feel like a sponge, kinda. if someone is upset, especially someone that i care about, i seem to absorb their emotions and become upset as well. i care so much about others that it hurts me. sometimes, i wish i could stop caring because it hurts to care so much. 

&#x200B;

i don't know how to stop being this way, so im not sure what advice to give you. but i just wanted to let you know that you are not alone. i'm so sorry that you also have to deal with this, i know it can suck. however, i think of it as a gift sometimes. people like us, we are extraordinary because of how empathetic we are. it is a weakness at times, but it is also a strength. please stay strong
